        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha akumposya Namani cilwele ca matana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namani ŵaliji jwamkulungwa jwa asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa mwenye jwa ku Siliya. Mwenye jwa ku Siliya ŵamcimbicisye Namani mnope, ligongo AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵamkamucisye jwalakwe pamo ni asilikali ŵakwe kwapunda amagongo ŵawo pa ngondo. Namani ŵaliji msilikali jwamacili soni jwakulimba mtima, nambo ŵaliji jwa matana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.4.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 4:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Siliya ŵamkamwile mwali jwa cilambo ca Isalaeli, ndaŵi jiŵajile kuputa ngondo kweleko. Ni ŵampelece mwalijo kuŵa jwakutumicila jwa ŵamkwawo Namani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line mwali jula ŵasalile ŵamkwawo Namani kuti, “Yikaŵe yakomboleka kuti ambuje ŵangu ŵajawile kuja kuwonegana ni mundu jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ku Samaliya, akajile kwaposya matana gawoga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵapikene Namani yiŵaŵecete mwalijo, ŵajawile kwa mwenye ni ŵasalile kuti, “Mwali jutwamkamwile ku Isalaeli jula eti akuŵeceta kuti uneji njawule ku Samaliya, kuti jwakulocesya jwali kwelekojo akambosye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye ŵamsalile jwalakwejo kuti, “M'mweji mjawule kweleko, une tinembe cikalata cakuti mkapelece kwa mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Namani ŵanyakwice ulendo ŵakwawula ku Samaliya, ali ajigele mbiya sya silifa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " 30,000, mbiya sya golidi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " 6,000, ni yakuwala ya sambano likumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali ayice kwa mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli, ŵapelece cikalata cicakwete maloŵe gakuti, “Apocele cele cikalataci. Mundu junatumicisyejo lina lyakwe Namani jwakutumicila jwangu, ngusosa kuti ŵalakwe amposye matana gakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli piŵamasile kuŵalanga cikalataco, ŵapapwile yakuwala yakwe ligongo lya canasa, ni ŵatite, “Ligongo cici mwenye jwa ku Siliya akunembela une cikalata cakuti namposye aju munduju? Ana akupela uneji Mlungu, jwakwete macili ga kuwulaga ni kupeleka soni umi? Yacimanyicile kuti jwalakweju akusosa magongo gakusaka kutandana ni uneji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵapikene jwakulocesya Elisha kuti mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli apapwile yakuwala yakwe, ŵamtumicisye maloŵe gakuti, “Ligongo cici apapwile yakuwala yawo? Ŵatumisye acalendowo kwa une, kuti amanyilile kuti ku Isalaeli kwana jwakulocesya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Namani ŵajawile kwa Elisha ni acibulu ni mageleta gakwe, ni ŵajile kwima pa mlango wa nyumba ja Elishajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha ŵamtumisye mundu kusa kuti akamsalile Namani kuti, “Ajawule akajoje mu Lusulo lwa Yolodani kasano ni kaŵili, nipo tapole cilwele cawo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namani piŵapikene maloŵe gelega, ŵatyosile pa malopo ali atumbile mnope. Ŵatyokaga aciŵecetaga kuti, “Une mbesileje takopoce ni kwika apano, ni kumbopelela uneji kwa AMBUJE Mlungu ŵakwe, ni kukwesya makono gakwe pacanya pa ulwele wanguwu, ni kumbosya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwambone, ana Abana ni Falipala, sulo sya ku Damasiko, ngasikupunda sulo syosope sya ku Isalaeli? Ana ngimkininapakombola kuja koga mu sulo syelesyo ni kupola?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵamasengo ŵakwe ŵajawile kwa jwalakwe ni ŵamwusisye kuti, “Pepani ambuje, ana jwakulocesyaju akasale kuti ŵalakwe atende cindu cacikulungwa, ana ngamkanatenda? Uli ŵalakwe ngagamba kunda kuja koga mu lusulomo, mpela mwaŵecetele, kuti ŵalakwe apole?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Namani ŵajawile ku Yolodani, ni ŵajile kutiŵila m'mesimo kasano ni kaŵili, mpela muŵaŵecetele Elisha mula. Ndaŵi jijojo ŵaposile. Nipo cilu cakwe cagambile kuŵa mya mpela ca mwanace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namani ni ŵandu ŵosope ŵaŵampecesye, ŵawujile kwa Elisha. Nipo Namani ŵajimi pameso pa Elisha ni ŵatite, “Une manyilile sambano kuti pacilambo capasi pangali Mlungu jwine, akaŵe jwa ku Isalaeli jika. Myoyo, conde pocelani mtukawu ŵakutyocela kwa une.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Elisha ŵajanjile kuti, “Ngulumbila pali AMBUJE, Mlungu ŵacijumi, ŵangwatumicila uneji kuti, ngambocela mtuka uliwose kutyocela kwenumwe.” Namani ŵalinjile kumkanganicisya kuti apocele, nambo jwalakwe ŵalimbile kukana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namani ŵatite kuti, “Yambone, naga ŵalakwe akukana, ngwaŵenda kuti angunde une kuti njigale kumangwetu litaka lyakunokuno, lyakwanila kunyakula abulu ŵatatu. Pakuŵa kutandila lelo une ngasindaga mbopesi syakutinisya, kapena mbopesi jilijose kwa mlungu jwine jwalijose, akaŵe kwa AMBUJE jikape basi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngwaŵenda AMBUJE kuti angululucileje une ndaŵi jingulongana nawo ambuje ŵangu mwenye, ku nyumba ja mapopelo ja Limoni, mlungu jwa ku Siliya, kuja kumlambila. Ngwete cikulupi kuti Ambuje tangululucile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha ŵamsalile kuti, “M'mweji kasimdandawula ni yeleyo, jendani mu mtendele.” Namani ŵawujile kumangwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha akumlwesa Gehasi ni ulwele wa matana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Namani ali ajesile mkuli ŵamnono, Gehasi, jwakutumicila jwa Elisha, ŵaganisisye mu mtima mwakwe kuti, “Ambuje ŵanguŵa amkundile Namani kuti ajawuleje, ŵangalipila kandu kalikose. Akajenele kupocela mtuka uŵayice nawo kupeleka mundu jwa ku Siliya jula. Ngulumbila pali AMBUJE, Mlungu ŵacijumi, une tinamwutucile kuti ngapocele kandu kwa jwalakwejo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Gehasi ŵamkuyiye Namani jula. Namani piŵalolite kuti mundu akumwutucila, ŵatulwice pa ligeleta lyakwe kuti amcingamile, ni ŵamwusisye Gehasi kuti, “Ana kwambone?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
