              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namani ŵatite, “Ŵalakwe ajigale mbiya sya silifa 6,000.” Myoyo ŵamkanganicisye kuti ajigale mbiyasyo, ŵasilonjile m'misaku jiŵili, pamo ni yakuwala yasambanoyo, ni ŵatwicile ŵamasengo ŵakwe ŵaŵili. Ŵatyosile pa malopo, ŵa masengowo pasogolo, Gehasi panyuma pawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gehasi piŵayice kwitumbi kujaliji nyumba ja Elisha, ŵapocele misaku jiŵili jila kwa ŵamasengo ŵala, ni ŵajijinjisye m'nyumba mwakwe. Ŵasalile ŵamasengo ŵa Namani ŵala kuti ajawuleje. Ali apite ŵa masengowo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gehasi ŵajinjile m'nyumba ja ambujegwe. Elisha ŵamwusisye kuti, “Ana Gehasi mwaliji kwapi?” Jwalakwe ŵajanjile kuti, “Une nganinjenda kulikose, ambuje.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha ŵamwusisye soni kuti, “Ana m'mweji mkuganisya kuti une nganinamwona, ndaŵi jatulwiceje Namani pa ligeleta lyakwe kukumcingamila m'mwejo? Gehasi, m'mweji nganimkola lilamusi lyakupocela mbiya ni yakuwala, migunda ja olifi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni ja mpeleya, ngondolo kapena ng'ombe, kapena acikapolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligongo lya yindu yimtesileyi, matana ga Namani tigaŵe pa m'mwejo, ni pa yisukulu yenu kwa yaka yosope.” Myoyo Gehasi ŵakopwece m'nyumbamo ali ni matana gamaswela pa cilu pakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.27",
